{"title":"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Beginning with a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2fd01dce4d24d42ee322b3591970b190897b399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2fd01dce4d24d42ee322b3591970b190897b399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2fd01dce4d24d42ee322b3591970b190897b399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> cube, a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/a/c8aadc1ed80b00a7c3dd47fae6dba112aee68bca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/a/c8aadc1ed80b00a7c3dd47fae6dba112aee68bca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/a/c8aadc1ed80b00a7c3dd47fae6dba112aee68bca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> cube is cut from one corner and a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/8/5682891715331cbf852f814caa96099bc7904118.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/8/5682891715331cbf852f814caa96099bc7904118.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/8/5682891715331cbf852f814caa96099bc7904118.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> cube is cut from the opposite corner. In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/0/bb06de78ae4ef6fc2731e0abb6788477c03a7b05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{cm}^2$\" width=\"27\" height=\"15\" />, what is the surface area of the resulting solid?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/7/e67185182297ec440e7d79dbdf157521e30fc351.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 42 \\quad \\text{(B) } 45 \\quad \\text{(C) } 48 \\quad \\text{(D) } 51 \\quad \\text{(E) } 54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"312\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</t